1
00:00:02,936 --> 00:00:05,086
(Penny:)Hey, have you ever heard of
the Van Nuys Comic-Con?

2
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:05,940
‭Yeah.

3
00:00:05,939 --> 00:00:08,469
(Leonard:)It's a dinky little convention
where they sell collectibles

4
00:00:08,475 --> 00:00:11,565
(Leonard:)and get sad D-list celebrities
to appear. Why?

5
00:00:11,562 --> 00:00:13,562
(Penny:)I got asked
to sign autographs there.

6
00:00:13,564 --> 00:00:15,984
That's awesome!

7
00:00:17,117 --> 00:00:18,537
(Leonard:)Is this for
Serial Ape-ist?

8
00:00:18,535 --> 00:00:20,155
(Penny:)Well, it could be
for the monkey movie.

9
00:00:20,154 --> 00:00:21,824
(Penny:)It could be
my hemorrhoid commercial.

10
00:00:21,822 --> 00:00:23,122
(Penny:)The list does not go on.

11
00:00:23,903 --> 00:00:25,373
- When is it?
- It doesn't matter.

12
00:00:25,375 --> 00:00:25,985
(Penny:)I'm not doing it.

13
00:00:26,009 --> 00:00:27,379
(Leonard:)What? Why not?

14
00:00:27,377 --> 00:00:28,877
(Penny:)You just said yourself,
it's sad.

15
00:00:28,879 --> 00:00:30,209
(Leonard:)Yeah, but it's
not pathetic.

16
00:00:30,214 --> 00:00:32,084
(Leonard:)That's where
I draw the line.

17
00:00:33,333 --> 00:00:34,713
Come on! We'll have fun.

18
00:00:34,718 --> 00:00:35,888
(Penny:)I don't know.

19
00:00:35,886 --> 00:00:37,966
(Leonard:)You'll have nerds
fawning all over you.

20
00:00:37,971 --> 00:00:40,671
(Leonard:)If you don't love that,
this marriage is in trouble.

21
00:00:40,674 --> 00:00:42,924
(Penny:)I guess it wouldn't hurt
to meet some fans

22
00:00:42,926 --> 00:00:44,426
(Penny:)and make a little extra money.

23
00:00:44,428 --> 00:00:45,898
(Leonard:)Yeah.

24
00:00:45,896 --> 00:00:48,976
Wow! An appearance
by George Lucas...

25
00:00:48,982 --> 00:00:51,152
...'s dermatologist.

26
00:00:52,486 --> 00:00:55,026
(Leonard:)- Oh, I want that autograph.
- Oh, yeah.

